<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Job Portal System - Find Your Dream Job</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Connect with top employers and job opportunities. Whether you're a job seeker or recruiter, Job Portal helps you find the perfect match.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <script src="/js/toast.js" defer></script>
    <style>
        /* ===== HOME NAVBAR ===== */
        .home-navbar {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #ea580c 100%);
            padding: 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(249,115,22,0.4);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .home-navbar .navbar-container {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 28px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 70px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .home-navbar .navbar-brand {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .home-navbar .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
            list-style: none;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .home-navbar .nav-links a {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 9px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .home-navbar .nav-links a:hover {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .home-navbar .nav-links .nav-cta {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #ea580c;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
        }
        .home-navbar .nav-links .nav-cta:hover {
            background: #fff7ed;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);
        }

        /* ===== HERO ===== */
        .hero-section {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff7ed 0%, #ffedd5 50%, #fed7aa 100%);
            padding: 130px 28px 100px;
            text-align: center;
            min-height: 580px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero-section::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -100px; right: -100px;
            width: 500px; height: 500px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(249,115,22,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .hero-section::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -80px; left: -80px;
            width: 400px; height: 400px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(234,88,12,0.10) 0%, transparent 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(249,115,22,0.12);
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.3);
            color: #ea580c;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .hero-section h1 {
            font-size: 60px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #7c2d12;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            max-width: 800px;
            position: relative; z-index: 1;
        }
        .hero-section h1 span { color: #f97316; }
        .hero-section p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            color: #92400e;
            max-width: 620px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            position: relative; z-index: 1;
        }
        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            position: relative; z-index: 1;
        }
        .hero-btn {
            padding: 18px 44px;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        .hero-btn-candidate {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #ea580c 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(249,115,22,0.5);
        }
        .hero-btn-candidate:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c 0%, #c2410c 100%);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(249,115,22,0.6);
        }
        .hero-btn-recruiter {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #ea580c;
            border: 2px solid #f97316;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(249,115,22,0.2);
        }
        .hero-btn-recruiter:hover {
            background: #fff7ed;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(249,115,22,0.3);
        }

        /* ===== STATS BAR ===== */
        .stats-bar {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #ea580c);
            padding: 32px 28px;
        }
        .stats-bar-inner {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
            text-align: center;
            gap: 24px;
        }
        .stat-bar-item h3 {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .stat-bar-item p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-weight: 500; }

        /* ===== FEATURES ===== */
        .features-section {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 100px 28px;
        }
        .features-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 42px;
            color: #7c2d12;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .section-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 17px;
            color: #92400e;
            margin-bottom: 64px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff7ed 0%, #ffedd5 100%);
            padding: 44px 36px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #fed7aa;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-align: left;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .feature-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; right: 0;
            width: 5px; height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f97316, #ea580c);
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(249,115,22,0.20);
            border-color: #f97316;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 52px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            display: block;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #7c2d12;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .feature-card p { color: #92400e; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }

        /* ===== GET STARTED SECTION ===== */
        .login-section {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff7ed 0%, #ffedd5 100%);
            padding: 100px 28px;
        }
        .login-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .login-options {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr));
            gap: 44px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .login-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 56px 48px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 2px solid #fed7aa;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(234,88,12,0.08);
        }
        .login-card:hover {
            border-color: #f97316;
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 44px rgba(249,115,22,0.20);
        }
        .login-card-icon { font-size: 72px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: block; }
        .login-card h2 { font-size: 30px; color: #7c2d12; margin-bottom: 14px; font-weight: 800; }
        .login-card p { font-size: 15px; color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 36px; line-height: 1.7; }
        .login-card-buttons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
        .login-card-btn {
            padding: 15px 28px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .primary-card-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #ea580c);
            color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(249,115,22,0.4);
        }
        .primary-card-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c, #c2410c);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(249,115,22,0.5);
        }
        .secondary-card-btn {
            background: #fff7ed;
            color: #ea580c;
            border-color: #f97316;
        }
        .secondary-card-btn:hover {
            background: #ffedd5;
            border-color: #ea580c;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* ===== ABOUT SECTION ===== */
        .about-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c 0%, #c2410c 100%);
            padding: 100px 28px;
        }
        .about-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .about-content h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .about-content p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .about-content .about-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #ea580c;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-top: 8px;
            transition: all 0.25s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        .about-content .about-link:hover {
            background: #fff7ed;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .about-visual {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border-radius: 24px;
            height: 360px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 120px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
        .home-footer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c2d12 0%, #431407 100%);
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            padding: 60px 28px 28px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .home-footer .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .home-footer .footer-links a {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .home-footer .footer-links a:hover { color: #fb923c; }
        .home-footer .footer-bottom {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            padding-top: 24px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
        }

        /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .home-navbar .navbar-container { flex-wrap: wrap; height: auto; gap: 12px; padding: 16px; justify-content: center; }
            .home-navbar .nav-links {
                flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: center;
            }
            .home-navbar .nav-links a { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
            .home-navbar .nav-links .nav-cta { padding: 8px 16px; }

            .hero-section { padding: 80px 20px 70px; }
            .hero-section h1 { font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: -1px; }
            .hero-section p  { font-size: 16px; }
            .hero-btn        { padding: 15px 28px; font-size: 15px; width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
            .hero-buttons    { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; max-width: 340px; }

            .stat-bar-item h3 { font-size: 28px; }
            .section-title { font-size: 30px; }
            .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .login-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .about-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .about-visual { height: 200px; font-size: 72px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <nav class="home-navbar">
        <div class="navbar-container">
            <a href="/" class="navbar-brand">🚀 Job Portal</a>
            <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links-list">
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
                <li><a href="#login">Get Started</a></li>
                <li><a href="/candidate/login">Candidate Login</a></li>
                <li><a href="/recruiter/login">Recruiter Login</a></li>
                <li><a href="/recruiter/register" class="nav-cta">Sign Up</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-badge">🔥 #1 Job Portal Platform</div>
        <h1>Find Your <span>Dream Job</span> or Hire Top Talent</h1>
        <p>Connect with opportunities and build your future. Whether you're seeking a job or looking for the right candidate, we're here to help.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#login" class="hero-btn hero-btn-candidate">👨‍💼 I'm Looking for a Job</a>
            <a href="#login" class="hero-btn hero-btn-recruiter">👔 I'm Hiring</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats Bar -->
    <div class="stats-bar">
        <div class="stats-bar-inner">
            <div class="stat-bar-item"><h3>10K+</h3><p>Active Users</p></div>
            <div class="stat-bar-item"><h3>5K+</h3><p>Job Listings</p></div>
            <div class="stat-bar-item"><h3>1K+</h3><p>Companies</p></div>
            <div class="stat-bar-item"><h3>95%</h3><p>Success Rate</p></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section class="features-section" id="features">
        <div class="features-container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Why Choose Our Job Portal?</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to land your dream job or find the perfect candidate — all in one place.</p>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🔍</span>
                    <h3>Easy Job Search</h3>
                    <p>Browse thousands of job listings and find positions that match your skills and experience with smart filters.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">📝</span>
                    <h3>Simple Application</h3>
                    <p>Apply to jobs in seconds with your profile. Track all your applications in one convenient dashboard.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">💼</span>
                    <h3>Post Opportunities</h3>
                    <p>Post job listings quickly and reach qualified candidates from across the country instantly.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">👥</span>
                    <h3>Talent Management</h3>
                    <p>Review applications, manage candidates, and make informed hiring decisions — all from your dashboard.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🔐</span>
                    <h3>Secure & Reliable</h3>
                    <p>Your data is protected with industry-standard security. Login safely with encrypted credentials.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">⚡</span>
                    <h3>Fast & Efficient</h3>
                    <p>Get connected with the right people quickly. No unnecessary steps — just results.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Get Started Section -->
    <section class="login-section" id="login">
        <div class="login-container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Get Started Today</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Choose your path and start your journey with Job Portal</p>
            <div class="login-options">
                <!-- Candidate Card -->
                <div class="login-card">
                    <span class="login-card-icon">👨‍💻</span>
                    <h2>For Job Seekers</h2>
                    <p>Find your perfect job. Explore thousands of opportunities from top companies and take your career to the next level.</p>
                    <div class="login-card-buttons">
                        <a href="/candidate/login" class="login-card-btn primary-card-btn">🔑 Login as Candidate</a>
                        <a href="/candidate/register" class="login-card-btn secondary-card-btn">✍️ Register as Candidate</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Recruiter Card -->
                <div class="login-card">
                    <span class="login-card-icon">💼</span>
                    <h2>For Recruiters</h2>
                    <p>Post job openings and connect with talented professionals. Build your dream team and grow your company faster.</p>
                    <div class="login-card-buttons">
                        <a href="/recruiter/login" class="login-card-btn primary-card-btn">🔑 Login as Recruiter</a>
                        <a href="/recruiter/register" class="login-card-btn secondary-card-btn">✍️ Register as Recruiter</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section class="about-section" id="about">
        <div class="about-container">
            <div class="about-content">
                <h2>About Our Platform</h2>
                <p>Job Portal is a comprehensive online employment platform designed to connect job seekers with employers. We believe in creating opportunities for everyone.</p>
                <p>Our mission is to simplify the hiring and job search process by providing a user-friendly platform where candidates can showcase their talents and employers can find the perfect fit.</p>
                <p>With our intuitive interface, we help bridge the gap between talent and opportunity — fast and efficiently.</p>
                <a href="#login" class="about-link">🚀 Get Started Now →</a>
            </div>
            <div class="about-visual">💡</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="home-footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#about">About</a>
                <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="#">Terms & Conditions</a>
                <a href="#">Contact</a>
                <a href="#">Blog</a>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>&copy; 2026 Job Portal System. All rights reserved. | Built with ❤️ for Developers</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
